        <span class="resume-section-label">Summary</span>
        <p>Product designer and creative technologist with 15+ years of experience across UX, interaction design, digital product development, UI systems, and brand definition. I lead at the intersection of human behavior, technology, and product strategy to make complex systems understandable.</p>
        <p>My experience spans AI-assisted products, enterprise platforms, healthcare technology, boutique branding &amp; advertising, and independent software products. I use code as a design tool - prototyping ideas, exploring interactions, understanding technical constraints, and collaborating with engineering teams.</p>
      </section>

      {# Experience #}
      <section class="resume-section">
        <span class="resume-section-label">Experience</span>

        <div class="resume-entry">
          <div class="resume-entry-header">
            <p class="resume-entry-title">Founder &amp; Product Designer</p>
