          <p class="resume-entry-body">Built and launched an independent platform mapping the Pacific Northwest creative technology ecosystem. Designed and developed a full-stack directory using Next.js, PostgreSQL, Prisma, and Vercel. Built information architecture supporting hundreds of creative businesses with structured discovery across location, discipline, and organization type. Conducted research through interviews and podcast production.</p>
          <p class="resume-entry-focus">Product Strategy · Information Architecture · Research · Full-stack Prototyping</p>
        </div>

        <div class="resume-entry">
          <div class="resume-entry-header">
            <p class="resume-entry-title">Senior UX Designer</p>
            <span class="resume-entry-dates">2021 – 2023</span>
          </div>
