          <p class="resume-entry-body">Sole designer on the responsive build within a 12-person design team spanning platform and design system. Led mobile adaptation across all screen sizes with user research conducted across US and British offices. Touch-adapted design system components were adopted as the mobile baseline across PwC's internal product ecosystem.</p>
          <p class="resume-entry-focus">Enterprise Systems · Mobile UX · Research · Design Systems</p>
