          <p class="resume-entry-body">Co-founded a location-based data platform using mapping technologies and user-generated geographic information. Owned product strategy, user research, and experience design. Represented the product within open mapping and civic technology communities, and worked with co-founder to define technical architecture.</p>
          <p class="resume-entry-focus">Emerging Technology · Product Strategy · Data Systems · Research</p>
        </div>

        <div class="resume-entry">
